  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centre for Humanitarian Dialogue Strategic Partnership Agreement Phase Three</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase Three of the Strategic Partnership Agreement (SPA) between DFAT and the Centre for Humanitarian Dialogue (CHD) provides regular analysis, insights and training to DFAT Canberra and posts on priority themes such as the interaction between conflict and development, gender, maritime affairs, migration, climate change, and cyber domains. SPA funding also enables CHD to directly engage in mediation in priority countries to address and prevent conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
